    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686490/extras/cb81f000b3b9fc750bcff28dbae91853.avif?t=1746037278\" /></div><br><br>It's Better Alone is a puzzle platformer where you must switch control between two characters in order to solve a variety of platforming puzzles.<br><br>A weathered man, haunted by the past.<br><br>A burdened robot, living to atone.<br><br>Work together, so that they can return home. Journey through a world in ruin, and uncover the events that led to the end of the world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Solve a variety of puzzles.<br></li><li> Switch control between two characters.<br></li><li> Journey through a world reclaimed by nature.<br></li><li> Uncover the events that led to the end of the world.<br></li><li> Strengthen the bonds between man and machine.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1686490/extras/cb81f000b3b9fc750bcff28dbae91853.avif?t=1746037278\" /></div><br><br>It's Better Alone is a puzzle platformer where you must switch control between two characters in order to solve a variety of platforming puzzles.<br><br>A weathered man, haunted by the past.<br><br>A burdened robot, living to atone.<br><br>Work together, so that they can return home. Journey through a world in ruin, and uncover the events that led to the end of the world.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Solve a variety of puzzles.<br></li><li> Switch control between two characters.<br></li><li> Journey through a world reclaimed by nature.<br></li><li> Uncover the events that led to the end of the world.<br></li><li> Strengthen the bonds between man and machine.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A weathered man, haunted by the past. A burdened robot, living to atone. Switch control between two characters, and have them work together in this single player puzzle platformer. Journey through a world in ruin, and discover the events that led to the end of the world.",
